{
    "title": "Depends on the Weather",
    "description": "When should we go?  Depends on the Weather!\r\n\r\nPlan better with weather!  Quickly know when to go with our exclusive green/yellow/red stoplight coloring.  Easily see the times when it\u2019s going to rain in your 10-day forecast.  Get your local weather forecast with live weather alerts.  Stop guessing at what your weather app is trying to tell you \u2013 directly see the times the weather will affect you!\r\n\r\nDo you just want to know when it\u2019s going to rain today?  We\u2019ve got you covered with rain timing in our 10-day forecast!  Track storms and get rainfall amounts for each day.\r\n\r\nLooking to find the best day this weekend to golf/hike/bike/run?  Easily identify the best day of the week with our green/yellow/red stoplight coloring.  We summarize the forecast into one color at each hour to make your decision making simple.\r\n\r\nSimplified weather forecasts to help you make quick and accurate decisions about when to plan your activities.  Get the timing forecast you need, with just a glance at our 10-day forecast.\r\n\r\nActionCast\r\n- Forecasts customized to you!\r\n- Find the optimal day of week and time of day for your activity.  \r\n- Color-coded forecasts for at-a-glance planning\r\n- Red/yellow/green stop light coloring\r\n- Weather forecasts tailored for your activity.\r\n- Thresholds based on how you feel outside.\r\n- Choose from 17 preset activities.\r\n- Create your own custom activities\r\n- Customize the weather thresholds to your preferences\r\n- Personalize your display to see what matters to you\r\n- Find out how confident we are in the forecast\r\n\r\n10-Day Forecast\r\n- Want a quick look at the week ahead?  Check out our 10-day\r\n- See the timing and amounts of rain/snow\r\n- Find out when to expect wind, thunderstorms, humidity, and more\r\n- A similar layout to TV weather forecasts\r\n\r\nGet forecasts to help you plan your favorite summer activities like going to the beach, boating on the lake, camping, going fishing, and swimming in the ocean or taking the kids to the pool.  Like to golf, but hate getting caught out in the rain?  Try our stoplight color coded ActionCast to find the best day of the week to play your round of golf.\r\n\r\nPlan the best time for outdoor activities like cycling, mountain biking, hiking, running, jogging, sports, and walking.  We also have you covered for fall and autumn with stoplight forecasts for gardening and yardwork.  In the winter, find the best days to catch that fresh powder skiing and snowboarding.\r\n\r\nSimply need to know when to walk your dog to avoid the rain?  Our ActionCast makes it easy to pick the best time to be outside with your dog.  We also have you covered for outdoor dining and picnics, as well as outdoor concerts and sports events, whether it\u2019s spring, summer, fall, or winter.\r\n\r\nForecasts currently available in the United States and Canada.  Weather warnings, watches, and advisories available in the United States as issued by the NOAA National Weather Service (NWS).\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.dependsontheweather.org/terms\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.dependsontheweather.org/privacy\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions, problems, or feedback, we would love to have a conversation with you at support@dependsonweather.org",
    "descriptionHTML": "When should we go?  Depends on the Weather!<br><br>Plan better with weather!  Quickly know when to go with our exclusive green/yellow/red stoplight coloring.  Easily see the times when it\u2019s going to rain in your 10-day forecast.  Get your local weather forecast with live weather alerts.  Stop guessing at what your weather app is trying to tell you \u2013 directly see the times the weather will affect you!<br><br>Do you just want to know when it\u2019s going to rain today?  We\u2019ve got you covered with rain timing in our 10-day forecast!  Track storms and get rainfall amounts for each day.<br><br>Looking to find the best day this weekend to golf/hike/bike/run?  Easily identify the best day of the week with our green/yellow/red stoplight coloring.  We summarize the forecast into one color at each hour to make your decision making simple.<br><br>Simplified weather forecasts to help you make quick and accurate decisions about when to plan your activities.  Get the timing forecast you need, with just a glance at our 10-day forecast.<br><br>ActionCast<br>- Forecasts customized to you!<br>- Find the optimal day of week and time of day for your activity.  <br>- Color-coded forecasts for at-a-glance planning<br>- Red/yellow/green stop light coloring<br>- Weather forecasts tailored for your activity.<br>- Thresholds based on how you feel outside.<br>- Choose from 17 preset activities.<br>- Create your own custom activities<br>- Customize the weather thresholds to your preferences<br>- Personalize your display to see what matters to you<br>- Find out how confident we are in the forecast<br><br>10-Day Forecast<br>- Want a quick look at the week ahead?  Check out our 10-day<br>- See the timing and amounts of rain/snow<br>- Find out when to expect wind, thunderstorms, humidity, and more<br>- A similar layout to TV weather forecasts<br><br>Get forecasts to help you plan your favorite summer activities like going to the beach, boating on the lake, camping, going fishing, and swimming in the ocean or taking the kids to the pool.  Like to golf, but hate getting caught out in the rain?  Try our stoplight color coded ActionCast to find the best day of the week to play your round of golf.<br><br>Plan the best time for outdoor activities like cycling, mountain biking, hiking, running, jogging, sports, and walking.  We also have you covered for fall and autumn with stoplight forecasts for gardening and yardwork.  In the winter, find the best days to catch that fresh powder skiing and snowboarding.<br><br>Simply need to know when to walk your dog to avoid the rain?  Our ActionCast makes it easy to pick the best time to be outside with your dog.  We also have you covered for outdoor dining and picnics, as well as outdoor concerts and sports events, whether it\u2019s spring, summer, fall, or winter.<br><br>Forecasts currently available in the United States and Canada.  Weather warnings, watches, and advisories available in the United States as issued by the NOAA National Weather Service (NWS).<br><br>Terms of Use: https://www.dependsontheweather.org/terms<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.dependsontheweather.org/privacy<br><br>If you have any questions, problems, or feedback, we would love to have a conversation with you at support@dependsonweather.org",
